.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-auth-list 1  "rev-stealth-auth-list " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-auth\-list \- List saved profiles (metadata only, cookie values never disclosed)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth auth list\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List every saved AuthStore profile. Only metadata is emitted (profile name, domain, created_at, expires_at, source); cookie values are never disclosed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth auth list
  $ rev\-stealth \-\-format json auth list

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Listing emitted.
  1  UserError        Bad args.
  3  PermanentError   AuthStore unavailable.

ENV:
  REV_SCRAPING_AUTH_DIR        Override the AuthStore directory.
